            "reviewer_id": "User_19622615_1_1",
            "review_title": "Review at Thơm Tea Lounge",
            "review_text": "Climber67720349051\n1 contribution\n0\nA great place to enjoy your afternoon tea\nMar 2026 • Friends\nI recently visited Thơm Tea Lounge inside Mai House Hotel, and it was a wonderful experience. The lounge has a spacious and elegant atmosphere, making it a perfect place to relax and enjoy some drinks with friends. The seating was very comfortable, and the overall environment was calm and pleasant.\n\nThe drinks and cakes were absolutely delicious. Everything was beautifully presented and tasted amazing.\n\nWhat impressed us the most was the excellent service. The staff were very enthusiastic, friendly, and welcoming. They made us feel comfortable throughout our visit. In particular, I would like to give special thanks to Mr. Luân and Ms. Vy for their kindness and attentive service. They were very helpful and made our experience even more enjoyable.\n\nIt is definitely a place I would recommend to others, would love to come back again in the future.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 14, 2026\nMarCom Manager\nDear Climber67720349051,\nXin chào, good morning.\nThank you for taking the time to share your wonderful experience at Thom Lounge with us.\nWe’re delighted to read your feedback regarding our delicious cakes, and our welcoming and friendly staff.\nWe'll share your kind comments Mr. Luân and Ms. Vy.\nWe look forward to welcoming you back again soon.\nWarm regards,\nThom Lounge Team\nRead more\nWritten July 22, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
