            "review_title": "Review at Thơm Tea Lounge",
            "review_text": "Nguyễn Thành Trung\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam13 contributions\n0\nHigh Tea at Thơm Lounge\nMar 2026 • Friends\nI had a lovely experience at Thơm Tea Lounge inside the beautiful Mai House Saigon Hotel. The atmosphere is elegant yet cozy, with a calm ambiance that makes it perfect for a relaxing afternoon tea.\nThe hotel itself has a charming, classic style that feels both luxurious and welcoming. Sitting in the lounge, surrounded by tasteful décor and soft lighting, really adds to the overall experience.\nWhat impressed me the most was the service. Mr. Tri and Mr. Kiet were incredibly attentive, warm, and professional. They made sure everything was perfect and added a very personal touch to the visit.\nThe Crêpe Suzette was absolutely delightful — freshly prepared, fragrant, and beautifully balanced in flavor. The pastries were also excellent, delicate and not overly sweet, which paired wonderfully with the tea.\nOverall, it was a memorable and relaxing experience. If you’re looking for a refined yet comfortable spot for tea and dessert in Saigon, Thơm Tea Lounge at Mai House Saigon is definitely worth a visit.\nRead more\nWritten March 14, 2026",
